  "description": "The proposed works to the site are to erect 2 x extraction flues (600mm diameter) to the exterior of the West facing wall of the property, these will be fixed to the wall and sit on a small gantry - the duct work will rise above the eaves height as per the drawings and be fitted with high velocity cowl to disperse the extracted air effectively. We will also install 2 x (1200mm square) air inlet louvre grills on the north face of the property. We also propose to install 4 x refrigeration compressors for the function of a walk-in freezer, fridge and blast chiller. Two of these will be used to power a freezer, 2 for a cold room and one for a blast chiller. These will located at ground level along the East wall of the property. That is the total work proposed.  ",
